      "text": "[9:05PM] #Sangotedo #TrafficUpdate \n\nUnder Bridge inw Ado Road (Thomas) is good traffic flow in both directions.\nUnder Bridge inw Eleko (via Adesanya, Alasia, Olokonla, Jonaith, Ogidan, ShopRite, Abijo, Awoyaya, Bogije, Igando, and Abulepanu) is good traffic movement.\n\nReturn journey from Eleko to Under Bridge (via Igando, Lakowe, Awoyaya, Abijo, ShopRite, Ogidan, Jonaith, Alasia, and Adesanya) is good traffic flow.\n\nNo records of impediments, with officers actively on ground to manage traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
