      "text": "[9:40PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Abule Ado through under bridge, Volks, Afolabi Ege down to Iyana Iba.\n\nMovement from intersection enroute Igando through First Gate, Iyana School to Obadore bridge is good, likewise the return journey.\n\nAlso, we have smooth movement along Badagry Expressway through Igbo Elerin junction, Iyana Isashi, Iyana Era to Custom check point.\n\nIn and out of Igbo Elerin is okay, Afolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
